      "summary": "Builds an init script that removes the remaining JavaScript-visible automation traces (navigator.webdriver, window.chrome, languages) for the configured locale.",
      "tags": ["browser-automation", "stealth", "init-script"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
